WEBVTT

03:08.548 --> 03:10.759
Thank the gods you're here, Stark.

03:11.801 --> 03:14.971
About time we had
some stern northern leadership.

03:16.181 --> 03:17.891
Glad to see you're protecting the throne.

03:18.016 --> 03:19.976
Sturdy old thing.

03:20.101 --> 03:22.437
How many kings' arses
have polished it, I wonder?

03:22.562 --> 03:24.314
Um, what's the line?

03:24.439 --> 03:27.692
The king shits and the Hand wipes.

03:28.693 --> 03:30.028
Very handsome armor.
